Vendored Helm chart — kubernetes-dashboard 7.14.0
=================================================

This directory is NOT this project's work. It is an upstream Helm chart and its
four subcharts, copied into the repository verbatim, and it is redistributed
with every clone of narwhal.

Why it is vendored
------------------
The upstream chart repository serves a 404 for its index.yaml, so `helm repo add`
cannot resolve the chart and an install that depends on it is not reproducible.
Vendoring makes the chart part of the tree that GitOps already tracks. See the
dashboard SSO notes in docs/ for the login contract this chart implements.

