Apache-2.0 §4 obligations
-------------------------
Redistribution of these files requires a copy of the license, retention of the
existing notices, and a statement of any changes. The license copy is this
repository's root LICENSE, which is the same Apache-2.0 text.

Helm chart archives do not carry LICENSE files, which is why there is none in
this directory to retain — that is an upstream packaging fact, not an omission
here, and it is the reason this file exists in its place.

Modifications
-------------
Values are supplied at install time rather than by editing the chart. The files
here were added by a single commit — f65f4b4, "fix(dashboard): vendor chart
7.14.0 — upstream helm index is 404" — and no commit has touched them since;
`git log -- gitops/charts/kubernetes-dashboard/` is the check.

That establishes no modification after import, which is not quite the same as
proving the import was byte-identical upstream. Stating the weaker claim is
deliberate: "we did not modify it" is something the Apache license makes
load-bearing, so it should not be asserted more strongly than it was verified.
If the chart is ever edited in place, record the change here.
